 exact IAPWS humid-air mixture. Carrier must remain positive; incipient liquid TP must remain on the stable compressed-liquid domain over all inverse evaluations.", "numerics": "Root-file analyst choices. Total-water/carrier/U explicit midpoint, then phase equilibrium decode at fixed total U. No extra latent-heat source, clipping, hidden timestep adaptation, or inferred real-material accuracy. Prescribed brackets define this demonstration domain.", "source_identity": "Local metadata and runtime version are recorded; source bytes are not attested. No SHA generation/comparison and no legacy host digest construction.", "phase_balance_derivation": "At fixed T and trial P, let pe=p_ref exp((mu_l-mu_v0)/(R*T)), vl=M/rho_l. From W=Nl+Nv, Vg=V-Nl*vl and Nv=pe*Vg/(R*T), Nl=(W-pe*V/(R*T))/(1-pe*vl/(R*T)); solve P=(Nc+W-Nl)*R*T/Vg. All-vapor candidate evaluated first."}, "verification": {"relative_step_ratios": [2, 2], "source_reference_temperatures_k": [300, 330, 340], "closed_cell_temperature_k": 330, "closed_cell_heat_inputs_j": [-0.05, 0, 0.05, 0.8], "phase_boundary_relative_water_offsets": [-1e-06, 0, 1e-06]}}, "water_source": {"facts_path": "/Users/wanggaoying/Desktop/brickmodel-github/data/sandbox/water/source_facts.json", "facts": {"source_type": "limited_factual_extract_not_full_nist_page", "source_url": "https://webbook.nist.gov/cgi/cbook.cgi?Name=water&cTC=on&cTG=on", "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-09-07T06:08:30.987483+00:00", "nist_database": "Chemistry WebBook SRD69", "nist_reference": "Chase,1998; same-reference Shomate H coefficients", "reference_temperature_k": 298.15, "gas_formation_h_j_mol": -241826.4, "liquid_formation_h_j_mol": -285830.4, "gas_shomate_temperature_range_k": [500, 1700], "liquid_shomate_temperature_range_k": [298, 500], "gas_standard_entropy_at_1bar_j_mol_k": 188.84, "nist_locator": "Gas Phase Heat Capacity row H; Liquid Phase Heat Capacity row H; gas standard entropy Chase row", "license_note": "NIST SRD compilation copyright retained; no page re